sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Seerr
    participant Arr as Sonarr / Radarr
    participant Prowlarr
    participant Indexer as NZBGeek
    participant SABnzbd
    participant Usenet as newsdemon.com
    participant Bazarr
    participant Provider as Subtitle provider
    participant Streamer as Jellyfin / Plex

    Seerr->>Arr: Request
    Arr->>Prowlarr: Search
    Prowlarr->>Indexer: Search indexer
    Indexer-->>Prowlarr: Releases
    Prowlarr-->>Arr: Releases
    Arr->>SABnzbd: Send grab

    SABnzbd->>Usenet: Download request
    Usenet-->>SABnzbd: Articles, written to /downloads/usenet/incomplete/
    SABnzbd-->>Arr: Done, in /downloads/usenet/complete/

    Note over Arr: Imports into /series/#lt;title#gt;/#lt;episode#gt;<br/>or /movies/#lt;title#gt;

    Arr->>Bazarr: New file
    Bazarr->>Provider: Request subtitles
    Provider-->>Bazarr: Subtitle file
    Bazarr->>Arr: Subtitle next to the file

    Arr->>Streamer: Library update
    Arr->>Seerr: Status update
